      "annotation_id": "b1e9bd2c163e4a458c585e1c936c3b72_106",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He further deposed that he was inside his shop and in the night he had heard the burst of cracker like sound and when he came out, he saw that crowd had gathered and Police officials had come but he was not inquired about anything nor his s"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9d22fd735e324cffaed32c5412f26493_107",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He further deposed that he did not know anything else."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "415eec6115474b6192a2669a48e8b698_108",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "At that stage Ld. APP had sought permission to cross examine the witness as he had turned hostile on the version recorded previously."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c7337dc5f19346d88a63ed533c74f292_109",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He deposed that \"Parvez is owner of the Yamin Hotel."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "95dcf62a91b2428889dafb9d90b1c6bf_110",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "I do not know whether Parvez was present at the hotel at the time of incident or not."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2610b802f98a40d29e65f4eec9229282_111",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is wrong to suggest that on the date of incident 3 boys came on a scooty outside the hotel and one of the three boys had fired a gunshot on Parvez present at the hotel."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b80b309430d14786853f0340b7ac7e04_112",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is wrong to suggest that I had seen the three boys coming on scooty."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3272aed9fec1466c9688f46c77e9d909_113",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is wrong to suggest one of the three boys who had fired the gunshot and was caught by Mohd. Parvez."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "29b269d3c9ac4a0ca0e7ac6bbcd1fcc3_114",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is wrong to suggest that when mohd.\nParvez tried to catch the boy he started firing several gunshots. It is wrong to suggest I was witnessing the whole incident and for the same reason police officials recorded my statement."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c927107e1cdf46e9b49ea1901a786517_115",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "I cannot say whether the date of incident is 06.09.2017 or the exact time of incident was 11:45 PM."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0dce212b0c654cbd983fd47c180fdc72_116",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "I State vs Monu @ Tanvir Mirza on 19 October, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/82691901/\n5 do not know anyone in the name of Monu @ Tanvir. \""
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b9db2a339a8744dca95e3ba101658e4d_117",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nAt that stage attention of witness was drawn towards accused Monu Tanvir, who was present in court on that day and seeing him witness stated that, \"I have seen him for the t time today and I do not identify him\"."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2b64797f55ec43dda1655c52d729e43f_118",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is wrong to suggest that I am deliberately not identifying the accused person or that I have settled the scores with the accused outside the court."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "87fea24b34c2429096cfe26a41149b3c_119",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is wrong tu suggest that I am deliberately not deposing the complete and correct facts as I have obtained gratification or been influenced by the accused."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7fec5aa4f7ff431a98244289efaa0c5c_120",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is wrong to suggest that I am deposing falsely.\""
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a71fb50ef2a14dc89e30ec9a09d3fb41_121",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "State Vs. Monu @ Tanvir Mirza"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e2fb603ce66947b88d9c8fcb4d947574_122",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He was not cross examined by Ld. Counsel for the accused despite opportunity."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6f0a4849e0414f9b91256dd119eccbc6_123",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "8. As can be seen, PW-1 Rafiq, PW-2 Mohd. Parvez, PW-3 Sahid Khan, PW-4 Azim and PW-5 Masood Alam, have neither supported the case of the prosecution nor have assigned any criminal role to the accused person and have not deposed anything in"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2233a8cd954a4b7194527c1d25abbf0b_124",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Further, they also failed to identify the accused in the Court."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a66104b27c1f4e68b61c9ea04530f060_125",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "No other witnesses have been examined by the prosecution to prove its case."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "993fd3edde954430ae98be7034a0c7d6_126",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In the circumstances, the prosecution evidence stands closed,\ndeclining the request of Ld. Additional Public Prosecutor for leading further evidence, as it shall be futile to record the testimonies of other witnesses, who are formal or offi"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "dcd6af7434cb4888b85e79582d6b92d7_127",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The precious Court time should not be wasted in recording the evidence of formal or official witnesses when the prosecution witnesses, i.e. PW1, PW2, PW3, PW4 and PW5 have not supported the case of the prosecution."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2dcef37e0aba49ceabf8754ca7c96f82_128",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The statement under section 313 of the Cr.P.C of accused Monu @Tanvir is dispensed with as there is nothing incriminating against him."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ab82f03601c4494eb80f7acaf0954794_130",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "I have also given my conscious thought and prolonged consideration to the material on record, relevant provisions of law and the precedents on the point."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1e88d806984247098953278d6eefc6ee_131",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "10. At this juncture, it is pertinent to refer to the judgment of Hon'ble Supreme Court of India in Sh.\nSatish Mehra vs Delhi Administration & Anr on 31 July, 1996, wherein it has been categorically held that :\n\"But when the Judge is fairly"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f5b893c6a06c4383a785bbd96237c63a_132",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "We are under heavy pressure of work-load."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8c14cce20c4a42d6a5b3e3e20c0401cf_133",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "If the Sessions Judge is almost certain that the trial would only be an exercise in futility or a sheer waste of time it is advisable to truncate or ship the proceedings at the stage of Section 227 of the Code itself\"\nDECISION 11."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "82bc7836b6ce45378252b62ad94d1ad4_134",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In view of the aforesaid discussion, with the prosecution failing to prove its case against the accused beyond reasonable doubt, accused Monu @ Tanvir Mirza, stands acquitted for the offence State vs Monu @ Tanvir Mirza on 19 October, 2024 "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f3d5f6dfd3734380a9e0d3d72ff37526_135",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "12. Case property, if any, shall be disposed of as per rules, after expiration of period of appeal and as per law."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "120cda76c2e84cf0b84e44485903ad5c_136",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
